WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.360
Outside sucks.

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:04.960
Thank God we invented the inside.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.840
What were they doing before there was inside?

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.720
Outside all the time.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:10.800
Hey, you can't go home.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:11.800
There's no home.

